00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:29.449
(laughs)
- I love it!

00:06:29.449 --> 00:06:31.920
(laughs)

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.230
- [Anthony] But it happened with K-Swiss,

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.510
