show right now, streaming.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.140
So you nailed, you hit
the nail on the head.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.376
But what I was wondering is,

00:06:53.376 --> 00:06:56.410
the thing that's making
all of this happen,

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.090
is it direct to consumer?

00:06:58.090 --> 00:06:59.860
So like you've got for instance,

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:02.050
the Atari 2600 which is coming back,

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:05.310
that's like on Indiegogo so
you buy that directly, right?

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.830
You have artists who

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.700
you have a lot on your show a lot,

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.607
they may not have the radio play,

00:07:11.607 --> 00:07:13.450
but they don't give a
shit 'cause they're still

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.240
making millions because they're still big

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.200
because of Spotify.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.033
- That's right.

00:07:17.033 --> 00:07:18.680
- [Anthony] So if you
look at all these things

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.070
